flowchart TD
    A[Restart Project] --> B[Open PowerShell at UCIP root]
    B --> C[Stop old Node processes<br/>Get-Process node -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force]
    C --> D[Install dependencies<br/>npm install]
    D --> E[Start app and API<br/>npm run dev]
    E --> F[Health check<br/>http://localhost:3001/api/v1/health -> ok true]

    F --> G[USSD Demo in second terminal]
    G --> H[Step 1: Open menu<br/>curl.exe -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/ussd/callback -d sessionId=demo-1&phoneNumber=%2B2348012345678&serviceCode=*384*UCIP%23&text=]
    H --> I[Expect CON menu options]
    I --> J[Step 2: Choose Heat<br/>text=1]
    J --> K[Expect CON severity prompt]
    K --> L[Step 3: Choose severity 4<br/>text=1*4]
    L --> M[Expect CON location prompt]
    M --> N[Step 4: Use my area and submit<br/>text=1*4*1]
    N --> O[Expect END + RPT-XXXX]

    O --> P[Show report ID in demo video]
